<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>save myself (this time)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">jeniverse</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">save myself (this time)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4c1vrmHBF3B2EdR3A3eWgt</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">4 Contributors</p><p ttm:agent="v1">save myself (this time) Lyrics</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How many times can I lose my mind?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any more tears left to cry?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I said that I just want to die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Starin' into the sun</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I let it burn into my eyes</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm trying to feel warm</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm trynna make it through the night</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I wanna start again</p><p ttm:agent="v1">A different person I'd be (Different person I'd be)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ooh, tell me there's a way</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To put this all behind me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Call the exorcist to fix this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To free me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Open up a [?] surgery</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To breath life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And give me one last try[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How many times can I lose my mind?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any more tears left to cry?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I said that I just want to die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Lived a hundred lives</p><p ttm:agent="v1">So how do I feel empty?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Now I'm paranoid</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Think everybody hates me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I pushed them all away ('Cause I pushed them all away)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Hopin' they'd forget me (Forget me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">These scars don't wanna fade (These scars don't wanna fade)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let it be a memory</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Pre-Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Call the exorcist to fix this</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To free me</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Open up a [?] surgery</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To breath life</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And give me one last try[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How many times can I lose my mind?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any more tears left to cry?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I said that I just want to die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How many times can I lose my mind?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any more tears left to cry?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I said that I just want to die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">How many times can I lose my mind?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Is there any more tears left to cry?</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I said that I just want to die</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">This time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Outro]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I really wanna save myself this time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I'm really gonna save myself this time</p></div></body></tt>